      "outputTokens": 782,
      "costUsd": 0.007092,
      "pronunciationText": "Last video ended on a stack of chairs. One chair is eighty centimetres tall, and every chair you add makes the stack six centimetres taller. So how tall is a stack of twenty chairs? Here's a quick guess. Start at eighty, and add twenty sixes. That gives two hundred centimetres, so it would only just fit under a two-metre door. It sounds right, but is it? By the end of the next few minutes, you'll know how to find any term, and whether that guess survives."
    },
