      "inputTokens": 53,
      "outputTokens": 414,
      "costUsd": 0.0037525,
      "pronunciationText": "To remember why it's n minus one, think of fence posts. Five posts in a row have only four gaps between them. Terms are the posts, and the steps are the gaps. So the nth term sits n minus one steps after the first."
    },
